# T4 LauncherChain: in-game evidence for settings the launcher wrote (docs/ui-plan.md, T4 section).
# Run: python tools/route.py Strict tools/routes/98_launcher_chain.dev --no-dvd --name <n> --seconds 200 SUNSHINE_DEV_START=dolpic/0 SUNSHINE_DEV_SKIP_MOVIES=1 SUNSHINE_DEV_SEED=1 SUNSHINE_DEV_NO_SHELL=1
# with build/Route/<n>/appdata/Sunshine/settings.ini pre-written ([launcher] last_image=<disc>) and SUNSHINE_DEV_LAUNCHER_ACTIONS=...
# Evidence lines: [launcher] action, [render] upscaler, widescreen: ... render width, [glyph], [cheats] ... loaded, [cheats-state] (water, nozzles).
waitfor director mario dirstate=4 timeout=3000
wait frames=90
log
hold trig=0,255 frames=60
log
shot lc.png
wait frames=60
log
end
